Third-party software in the Farming RPG Maker player
====================================================

This game runs on farm-player, the Farming RPG Maker game player. The player
includes the open-source Rust crates listed below. Their licenses follow. The
source code of each crate is available from crates.io
(https://crates.io/crates/<name>/<version>).

The player also embeds the Inter typeface (Regular and Bold) under the SIL Open
Font License 1.1; its license is at the end of this file.

